    <description
    >Distribute new inbound leads fairly across sales reps using quantum-certified randomization. Triggers when a Lead is created in an unassigned queue, collects available reps, and calls QuantumFair for provably fair Uniform assignment. Results arrive via Quantum_Job_Complete__e Platform Event. Pair with Quantum_Apply_Lead_Assignment to auto-update Lead owners.</description>
